{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1480","id":4013481528,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87vON44","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1480","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1480.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1480.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1480","number":1480,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"ci: harden security guard trust boundary","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Split the CI Security Guard workflow into PR and trusted-repository execution paths.\n- On `pull_request`, checkout trusted base code into `trusted-guard` and candidate PR code into `candidate-repo` with `persist-credentials: false`.\n- Run the guard script from `trusted-guard/scripts/security/check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py` against `candidate-repo/.github/workflows`.\n- Block PR changes to the guard workflow, guard script, and guard tests by default so guard implementation changes require trusted maintainer handling.\n- Add a workflow integrity regression test that fails if the PR path starts using candidate guard code again.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nThe guard workflow previously ran on `pull_request`, checked out the candidate workspace, then executed the guard script and tests from that candidate checkout. A malicious PR could modify both workflow files and the guard implementation to make unsafe workflow changes pass.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 tests/security/test_check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py`\n- `python3 tests/security/test_ci_security_guard_workflow_integrity.py`\n- `python3 scripts/security/check_no_self_hosted_pull_request.py .github/workflows`\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json`","created_at":"2026-07-08T09:57:55Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T10:16:21Z","closed_at":"2026-07-08T10:16:21Z","merged_at":"2026-07-08T10:16:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"7287a5a5f9dbb6ccb44ded4ef481ee4b0764bb1e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1480/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1480/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1480/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/1f595740dd50ba4374c124f2abb0f66ee2c0a0b1","head":{"label":"Samsen879:codex/ci-security-guard-trusted-base-fix","ref":"codex/ci-security-guard-trusted-base-fix","sha":"1f595740dd50ba4374c124f2abb0f66ee2c0a0b1","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879